[00:01.68]1. Jehovah, this is the day;
[00:10.74]Now from our hearts, we want to pray.
[00:17.36]How you have honored us, favored us,
[00:23.84]More than words can say!
[00:29.70]Upon our labor of love,
[00:35.46]We’ve seen your blessing from above.
[00:41.34]And now a building stands, by our hands,
[00:47.88]As the proof thereof.
[00:53.32](Chorus)
[00:53.38]Jehovah God, it was a priv’lege
[00:58.78]For us to build this place for you.
[01:04.94]May we continue in your service throughout our days
[01:13.80]And bring you praise in all we do.
[01:28.96]2. What happy faces we see,
[01:34.08]And what good friends we’ve come to be!
[01:40.84]And how we’ll cherish these memories
[01:51.79]For eternity!
[01:53.27]We saw your spirit, O Lord,
[01:59.31]In how we worked with one accord.
[02:05.37]And how we’ve added fame to your name;
[02:11.91]What a grand reward!
[02:17.39](Chorus)
[02:17.59]Jehovah God, it was a priv’lege
[02:22.79]For us to build this place for you.
[02:29.01]May we continue in your service throughout our days
[02:37.85]And bring you praise in all we do.
